    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illaudābĭlis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inl-</span></b> ), e, adj.
		in-laudabilis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>not worthy of praise</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 5, 5, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illaudatus est quasi illaudabilis, qui neque
					mentione aut memoria ulla dignus neque umquam nominandus
					est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					2, 6, 17</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. G. 3,
		5</span></i>.</div>
